# Wild Wings: Storm Chaser

## Project Overview

Wild Wings: Storm Chaser is an educational side-scrolling flight action/adventure game designed for children ages 6-8 (grades 1-3). The game transforms reading practice into an exhilarating flight adventure where ornithological knowledge directly translates to gameplay power.

## Core Concept

**"Read about birds to fly like birds."**

Every animal fact learned unlocks that bird's real-world flight ability as a usable power. Children don't read to earn game time—they read to master the skies. Knowledge equals power, literally.

## Target Platform

- **Primary**: iOS/Android tablets
- **Potential**: PC/Console ports
- **Current Prototype**: Web-based (React)

## Educational Value

- **Reading Volume**: 500-800 words per 30-minute session
- **Vocabulary Exposure**: 200+ ornithology and nature terms
- **Reading Level**: Lexile 200-500L (grades 1-3)
- **Retention Method**: Immediate application of learned information through gameplay

